      "content": "2.1 Hardware"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Hardware refers to the physical, tangible parts of a computer system.",
        "Software consists of the set of instructions and programs that direct the hardware.",
        "Firmware is software embedded permanently into hardware ROM chips.",
        "Humanware encompasses the personnel who operate, program, and maintain computer systems."
      ],
